---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { ArrowRight, Image, PanelsTopLeft, GitBranch, ExternalLink } from '@lucide/astro';
---
<Base title="Loftwah’s connected apps" description="My Linkarooie profile and guestbook run together in App Composer, with their own source, content and storage.">
 <div class="composition-heading">
  <h1>My profile. Your contributions.</h1>
  <p class="lede">Linkarooie brings together my music, games, projects and writing. The guestbook is where visitors can leave a postcard for me to review.</p>
  <div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/showcase/">Open my profile <ArrowRight size={18} aria-hidden="true"/></a><a class="button secondary" href="/guestbook/">Visit the guestbook</a></div>
 </div>
 <section class="composition-flow" aria-labelledby="flow-title">
  <h2 id="flow-title">From contribution to collection</h2>
  <ol>
   <li><strong>Submit</strong><span>An invited contributor sends a photo to Here / there.</span></li>
   <li><strong>Approve</strong><span>The owner reviews it before anything is public.</span></li>
   <li><strong>Feature</strong><span>Linkarooie adds the approved photo to its collection.</span></li>
   <li><strong>Open</strong><span>The card leads back to the original contribution.</span></li>
  </ol>
  <p class="small">Hide or delete the source and it disappears from both public views on the next request. Downloaded copies cannot be recalled.</p>
 </section>
 <div class="composition-pair">
  <section aria-labelledby="guestbook-title">
   <a class="composition-preview" href="/guestbook/" aria-label="Open Here / there guestbook"><img src="/brand/courtyard-ai-v1.jpg" alt="Generated fictional courtyard with terracotta walls and a green chair" width="1200" height="630" loading="lazy"/></a>
   <h2 id="guestbook-title"><Image size={24} aria-hidden="true"/>Here / there</h2>
   <p>Collect photos and messages. Review each contribution, publish it or keep it private.</p>
   <div class="app-links"><a class="button secondary" href="/guestbook/">Open guestbook <ArrowRight size={18} aria-hidden="true"/></a><a href="https://guestbook.loftwah.com">Standalone app <ExternalLink size={16} aria-hidden="true"/></a><a href="https://github.com/loftwah/app-composer-guestbook">Source <GitBranch size={16} aria-hidden="true"/></a></div>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="showcase-title">
   <a class="composition-preview" href="/showcase/" aria-label="Open Linkarooie showcase"><img src="/brand/creators/loftwah-banner-v1.jpg" alt="Loftwah’s kangaroo in green and gold at a concert" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy"/></a>
   <h2 id="showcase-title"><PanelsTopLeft size={24} aria-hidden="true"/>Linkarooie</h2>
   <p>Arrange your own links alongside approved photos. Each linked photo keeps its source and current visibility.</p>
   <div class="app-links"><a class="button secondary" href="/showcase/">Open showcase <ArrowRight size={18} aria-hidden="true"/></a><a href="https://showcase.loftwah.com">Standalone app <ExternalLink size={16} aria-hidden="true"/></a><a href="https://github.com/loftwah/app-composer-showcase">Source <GitBranch size={16} aria-hidden="true"/></a></div>
  </section>
 </div>
 <details class="composition-details"><summary>How the apps work together</summary><p>These are independently deployed apps with separate GitHub repositories, configuration and storage. Composer runs reviewed source versions together; Linkarooie asks Guestbook for currently approved items through a versioned contract.</p><p>This is the owner’s live profile and guestbook. The guestbook’s original generated photo samples are labelled; visitor contributions require owner approval. Owner administration and public browsing remain separate.</p><a href="/release">See the verified composition and recovery evidence</a></details>
</Base>
